{
    "title": "GoHenry by Acorns Kids Banking",
    "description": "GoHenry by Acorns is the debit card & banking app for kids and teens. Young people aged 6-18 can learn about earning, saving, and smart spending with features like automated allowance, task lists, and gamified educational quizzes and videos. Then they can practice their skills in the real world with their own debit card. All while parents watch and guide with flexible parental controls. That\u2019s why 92% of parents say their children are more money-confident since joining GoHenry.\r\n\r\n\r\nGOHENRY BY ACORNS KIDS\u2019 BANKING BENEFITS:\r\n\r\n- AUTOMATED ALLOWANCE\r\nAutomated weekly allowance teaches budgeting skills and that once their money is gone, it\u2019s gone.\r\n\r\n- SAVINGS, STASHED\r\nMake saving a habit with child-led savings goals that parents can lock and unlock.\r\n\r\n- IN-APP TASK LISTS\r\nTeach the power of earning by sending rewards for completed chores.\r\n\r\n- BITE-SIZED LESSONS\r\nBoost your child\u2019s financial literacy with in-app Money Missions. On average, kids transfer over 30% more into their savings in the first month after completing one.\r\n\r\n- THEIR OWN PREPAID CARD\r\nYour child can practice their new skills in the real world with their own kids\u2019 debit card\u2014and choose from 45+ designs.\r\n\r\n- TRAVEL ABROAD FEE-FREE\r\nHead on holiday as a family with fee-free transactions overseas.\r\n\r\n- MONEY SKILLS UNLOCKED\r\nYour child can learn money management skills by \u200b\u200btracking their own cash flow in-app.\r\n\r\n- ATM WITHDRAWAL\r\nHeading somewhere that only takes cash? Your child can withdraw money at ATMs.\r\n\r\n\r\nGOHENRY BY ACORNS PARENT BENEFITS:\r\n\r\n- QUICK AND EASY TRANSFERS\r\nSend money anytime with scheduled allowance and instant transfers.\r\n\r\n- INCENTIVIZE CHORES\r\nSet task lists and send rewards for completed chores.\r\n\r\n- SPENDING VISIBILITY\r\nTrack your kid\u2019s money with real-time notifications straight to your phone.\r\n\r\n- FLEXIBLE CONTROLS\r\nChoose when, where and how much your child spends\u2014and change your preferences anytime in-app.\r\n\r\n- A FAMILY AFFAIR\r\nFamily and friends can send money straight to your child\u2019s card with Giftlinks and Relatives accounts.\r\n\r\n- JUST FOR YOU\r\nFind insights and tips to support your child\u2019s financial education in the Parent Space.\r\n\r\n- GIVING MADE EASY\r\nTeach your child the value of helping others with optional charitable donations in-app.\r\n\r\n\r\nGOHENRY BY ACORNS TEEN BANKING BENEFITS: YOU`LL NEED A PARENT OR GUARDIAN TO SIGN YOU UP\r\n\r\n- THE ACCOUNT THAT GROWS WITH YOU\r\nGrow your independence with a teen debit card and 13+ account with features just for teens.\r\n\r\n- SPLIT THE BILL\r\nRequest or send money with friends on GoHenry by Acorns anytime.\r\n\r\n- REQUEST MONEY, GET PAID\r\nGet paid in person with QR codes\u2014even if that person doesn\u2019t use GoHenry by Acorns.\r\n\r\n- SAVINGS YOU CONTROL\r\nSet savings goals in-app for those must-have purchases.\r\n\r\n- READY FOR YOUR SIDE HUSTLE\r\nGet paid wages straight to your account with Direct Deposits (14+).\r\n\r\n- YOUR MONEY SIDEKICK\r\nSet up your card with Google Pay\u2122 for fast and secure payments on the go.\r\n\r\n- FREE TO PAY AWAY\r\nSet off and explore with fee-free transactions overseas.\r\n\r\n- MAP YOUR SPENDING\r\nStay on top of your spending habits by tracking your cash flow with spending maps.\r\n\r\n\r\nLET\u2019S GET STARTED!\r\n1. Sign up today\r\n2. Download the app & learn instantly with Money Missions\r\n3. Parents can set allowance, chores & add money\r\n4. Activate your card when it arrives in 5-7 days\r\n\r\n\r\n54k+ 5 star reviews on Trustpilot & the App Store & Google Play stores worldwide.\r\n\r\n\u00a9 GoHenry Inc. GoHenry is not a bank. The GoHenry card is issued by Community Federal Savings Bank, member FDIC, pursuant to license by Mastercard International.\r\n\r\nGoogle Pay is a trademark of Google LLC.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.gohenry.com/us/terms-and-conditions/\r\n\r\nGoHenry by Acorns Address: 5300 California Avenue, Irvine, CA 92617 USA",
